Rex May, the author of Ceqli language (probably the first loglanoid in
history) died July this year.

https://www.facebook.com/rex.may2

Just to note:
1. He provided loglandic magazines with his pictures.
2. gua\spi language borrowed is phonotactics from Ceqli
3. Lojban community is familiar with Rex May by this adaptation of his
"picture introduction" to Lojban:
https://mw.lojban.org/papri/le_lisxra_cu_xe_fanva_fo_zo%27oi_Ceqli

